<x-layouts.app title="Content & privacy"><div class="page-container info-page"><p class="eyebrow">CLEAR EXPECTATIONS</p><h1>A useful, respectful learning space.</h1><h2>Learning material</h2><p>Use resources to understand ideas and practise independently. Do not use the service to distribute confidential examinations, personal information, or material you do not have permission to share. The foundation examples are original demonstration learning content and await formal curriculum review.</p><h2>Corrections and rights concerns</h2><p>Signed-in users can report concerns directly from each resource. Administrators can review reports, correct content, or withdraw it. Withdrawn content is removed from the public library.</p><h2>Data in this development release</h2><p>Your account stores your name, email, password hash, grade, bookmarks, reading history and practice attempts. Reports and administrative changes are also recorded. Profiles and attempt results are private to your account and authorized administration.</p><h2>Before public launch</h2><p>This is a development release. The operator must finalize the production privacy notice, retention and deletion process, support contact, content licenses and applicable local requirements before opening public registration on a live domain.</p></div></x-layouts.app>
